§§ `7. ערך שעה ושעות גיל`

-- akn:art_7/p1 Introduces the quotation of the agreement's §15(ב); the rule is the founding agreement's, below.

-- ¶2–¶6: §15(ב) as the circular quotes it: the founding agreement's
-- `the Oz hour value` and `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772`
-- (imported). A base of 17,320 over 4.33 × 40, and of 10,392 over 4.33 ×
-- 24, is 100.
@ref akn:art_7/p2 akn:art_7/p3 akn:art_7/p4 akn:art_7/p5 akn:art_7/p6
`section 15(ב) as circular תשע"ד/2 quotes it` MEANS
        `the Oz hour value` 17320 EQUALS 100
    AND `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772` 10392 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `section 15(ב) as circular תשע"ד/2 quotes it`

-- akn:art_7/p7 The decision's §6(א), the new §15(ג): `the Oz hour value, as section 15(ג) reduces it` and `the hour value off the Oz reform, as section 15(ג) reduces it` (imported).
-- akn:art_7__para_a The decision's §6(ב), §32 reading "15(ב) and 15(ג)": `the hour value in part application, as section 15(ג) reduces it` (imported).
-- akn:art_7__para_b The decision's §6(ג): `section 6 of the 2013 decision governs the school year` (imported).

