§§ `9. מכסה מינימלית של שעות פרונטליות לבעלי תפקיד`

-- akn:art_9/p1 The opening, "in §17 of the agreement"; the circular prints the decision's §8(ב) and not its §8(א).

-- (א): the decision's §8(ב), the table that replaces §17(ד):
-- `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least under the 2013
-- decision` (imported). The circular adds two examples of its own: a
-- homeroom teacher at about 83% of a position (20 frontal hours) teaches
-- 10 in fact, 50% of 20; at about 42% (10 frontal hours), 6 and not the 5
-- that 50% of 10 would be.
@ref akn:art_9__para_a
`the examples circular תשע"ד/2 gives of section 17(ד) hold` MEANS
        `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least under the 2013 decision` `the Oz homeroom teacher` FALSE 20 EQUALS 10
    AND `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least under the 2013 decision` `the Oz homeroom teacher` FALSE 10 EQUALS 6
    AND 50% TIMES 10 LESS THAN 6
#ASSERT `the examples circular תשע"ד/2 gives of section 17(ד) hold`

