-- akn:art_11/p1 The decision's §10, word for word, the new table of §20(ב): `the evaluation points of the year, as the 2013 decision amends section 20(ב)` (imported); a role holder in none of its columns is read as the founding agreement reads it (F-oz-founding-20-a, convention reading.role-table-column).

§§ `12. תוספת מעבר לרפורמה`

-- akn:art_12/p1 The opening, "in §24 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

-- ¶2, the circular's own: "בהתאם להחלטת ועדת היגוי מיום 24.12.2013, הוחלט
-- כי תחולת סעיף זה הינה מיום תחילת רפורמת עוז לתמורה". The decision of
-- 24.12.2013 is not in the corpus; the circular reports it, and it speaks
-- of the whole section, (א) to (ג). The reform started with the school
-- year תשע"ב, on 1.9.2011 (§46's day). The decision of 28.5.2013 gives its
-- §11 no day, and an undated section governs from the decision's day
-- (convention dates.undated-amendment); here the text answers otherwise,
-- and this is that convention's exception.
@ref akn:art_12/p2
`the day the Oz reform started, by circular תשע"ד/2` MEANS `the day the Oz school year opens` `the school year 5772`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 12 of circular תשע"ד/2 governs on` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the day the Oz reform started, by circular תשע"ד/2`

-- (א), the decision's §11(א) word for word, dated by ¶2: from the reform's
-- start the transition supplement's base takes the 2011 supplement and the
-- 2011 erosion supplement as well. From the decision's day it is the
-- decision's base (imported); between the reform's start and that day,
-- the same two supplements are added to the decision's base, which there
-- is §24(א)'s as signed.
@ref akn:art_12__para_a
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the transition supplement's base under circular תשע"ד/2` c IS
    IF      `section 12 of circular תשע"ד/2 governs on` (c's `the day`)
        AND NOT `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` (c's `the day`)
    THEN `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` c
         PLUS `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (c's `the day`) (c's `the combined salary`) (c's `the 2001 supplement`) (c's `the 2008 supplement`)
         PLUS `the erosion supplement under section 39` (c's `the day`) (c's `the combined salary`) (c's `the 1987 supplement`) (c's `the 1994 supplement`) (c's `the 2008 supplement`) (c's `the 2001 supplement`)
    ELSE `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` c

-- ¶3, the circular's own, "למען הסר ספק": an existing or a new principal
-- is entitled to the transition supplement only while employed on the
-- reform's terms, as a principal. That is the decision's rule as encoded
-- (imported): `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013
-- decision` asks a school applying the reform and a principal who is an
-- existing one or a new one paid as one (the decision's §12, the
-- circular's §13, which ¶2 does not date back). It is the reading
-- F-oz-higui-2013-f takes of the 1987 transition supplement, too.
@ref akn:art_12/p3
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` m e c `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e (c's `the day`) `the parties agreed otherwise`
    THEN `the transition supplement rate` TIMES `the transition supplement's base under circular תשע"ד/2` c
    ELSE 0

-- (ב), the decision's §11(ב) word for word, dated by ¶2: the transition
-- supplement carries training-fund contributions from the reform's start.
@ref akn:art_12__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE, p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the transition supplement counts, under circular תשע"ד/2, on` d p IF
       `the transition supplement counts, as the 2013 decision amends section 24(ג), on` d p
    OR (    `section 12 of circular תשע"ד/2 governs on` d
        AND p EQUALS `contributions to a training fund`)

-- (ג), the decision's §11(ג) word for word, dated by ¶2: the 1987
-- transition supplement, half the 1987 supplement, from the reform's start
-- (the decision's share, imported).
@ref akn:art_12__para_c
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, d IS A DATE
      `the 1987 supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc the principal's own
      `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` m e d `the 1987 supplement` `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF      `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e d `the parties agreed otherwise`
        AND `section 12 of circular תשע"ד/2 governs on` d
    THEN `the 1987 transition supplement's share of the 1987 supplement` TIMES `the 1987 supplement`
    ELSE 0

