§§ `דוגמאות`

-- An existing principal (the founding agreement's example) with the
-- decision's components: on 1.1.2013, after the reform's start and before
-- the decision, the circular's base takes the 2011 and erosion
-- supplements, which the decision's does not yet; on 1.9.2013 the two are
-- one.
#ASSERT `the transition supplement's base under circular תשע"ד/2` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)) GREATER THAN `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013))
#ASSERT `the transition supplement's base under circular תשע"ד/2` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)) EQUALS `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013))
#ASSERT `the transition supplement's base under circular תשע"ד/2` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011)) EQUALS `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011))
#ASSERT `the transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in part` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)) FALSE EQUALS `the transition supplement under the 2013 decision` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in part` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)) FALSE
#ASSERT `the transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` `an existing principal` `off the Oz reform` (`a principal's components on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)) FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the transition supplement counts, under circular תשע"ד/2, on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012) `contributions to a training fund`
#ASSERT NOT `the transition supplement counts, as the 2013 decision amends section 24(ג), on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012) `contributions to a training fund`
#ASSERT NOT `the transition supplement counts, under circular תשע"ד/2, on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011) `contributions to a training fund`
#ASSERT `the 1987 transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in full` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) 300 FALSE EQUALS 150
#ASSERT `the 1987 transition supplement` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in full` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) 300 FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 1987 transition supplement under circular תשע"ד/2` `an existing principal` `off the Oz reform` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) 300 FALSE EQUALS 0

-- §11 has one reading, the founding agreement's: a counsellor in the top
-- 15% of תשע"ג is in the coordinators' column, 2.5 points; a homeroom
-- teacher who coordinates a subject earns the more of his two columns.
#ASSERT `the evaluation points of the year, as the 2013 decision amends section 20(ב)` `the school year 5773` (LIST `the Oz educational counsellor`) 0 100 EQUALS 2.5
#ASSERT `the evaluation points of the year, as the 2013 decision amends section 20(ב)` `the school year 5773` (LIST `the Oz deputy principal`) 20 100 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the evaluation points of the year, as the 2013 decision amends section 20(ב)` `the school year 5773` (LIST `the Oz homeroom teacher`, `the Oz subject coordinator`) 0 100 EQUALS 4
